        ["In Calibrate, drag the Move / Rotate / Scale gizmo or use the numeric controls to translate, rotate and uniformly scale the keyboard. Note travel has its own separate controls."] = "In Calibrate, drag the Move / Rotate / Scale gizmo or use the numeric controls to translate, rotate and uniformly scale the keyboard. Note travel has its own separate controls.",
        ["In Perform mode, each MIDI Note On creates a distinct calibrated 3D note at the key; it rises opposite the yellow Learn arrow. Its body starts at a short minimum, grows with hold duration up to a quarter of its visual reach, then freezes on Note Off. It keeps moving and fades near its fixed three-second reach even if still held, independent of Learn lookahead. Repeated same-pitch strikes stay separate. This stream is independent of key tint and optional live press bars; it requires a valid calibration."] = "In Perform mode, each MIDI Note On creates a distinct calibrated 3D note at the key; it rises opposite the yellow Learn arrow. Its body starts at a short minimum, grows with hold duration up to a quarter of its visual reach, then freezes on Note Off. It keeps moving and fades near its fixed three-second reach even if still held, independent of Learn lookahead. Repeated same-pitch strikes stay separate. This stream is independent of key tint and optional live press bars; it requires a valid calibration.",
